{"hw":"συνίζω","html":"<div class=\"lex-entry\"><h4 class=\"lex-hw gk\">συνίζω</h4><span class=\"lex-orth gk\">συνίζ-ω</span>, <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"1\"><span class=\"lex-n\">A</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">sit together, hold a sitting</b> (for the discharge of business), of a court of magistrates, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hdt.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">6.58</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"3\"><span class=\"lex-n\">2</span> <b class=\"lex-tr\">fall together, collapse</b>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Hp.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Oct.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">11</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Pr.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">868a18</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">927b34</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Resp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">479b14</span> </span>, <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Thphr.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Sud.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">25</span> </span>; so <span class=\"gk\">εἰς ταὐτὸν ς</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Pl.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Ti.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">72d</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸν ἄργυρον συνιζῆσαι τακέντα</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Plu.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">2.665b</span> </span>; <span class=\"gk\">τὸ συνιζηκὸς τῶν πόρων</span> <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Gal.</span> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">10.472</span> </span>. </div> <div class=\"lex-sense\" data-level=\"2\"><span class=\"lex-n\">II</span> causal, <b class=\"lex-tr\">make to sink</b>, <span class=\"gk\">τὸν πνεύμονα αἴρειν καὶ ς</span>. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-author\">Arist.</span> <cite class=\"lex-cite-title\">Resp.</cite> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">479a27</span> </span>, cf. <span class=\"lex-cite\"> <span class=\"lex-cite-scope\">475a8</span> </span>.</div></div>"}